+Implements the computation of interest rates based on the current state of the reserve. This interest rate model utilizes two distinct slopes: one applicable before reaching the
+OPTIMAL_USAGE_RATIO
+, and another that applies from that point up to full utilization (100%).
+Due to caching of the
+PoolAddressesProvider
+, an instance of this contract cannot be shared across different Hyperlend markets.
+The source code is available on GitHub.
